author ai
group features/gui
note In the Paths tab, press 'new path' beside the filter: a form opens under it with a name field (it takes the keyboard), the three kinds as buttons (flow chosen), and a group field filled with the group of the path being read. Press 'create', or enter in either field: the path is added to the map with that kind and group, authored by the human, and opened empty in the document, which says how to add steps (feature-add-step). The form closes. An empty name keeps the form open and says to type one; an invalid name or one that exists is refused in the status bar. Pressing 'new path' again closes the form.

