note The handler. Only while the form is open. A blank name refocuses the name field; a name already in the map is refused as taken rather than reopened, since add_path would accept it silently and set_group would then move that path. On success the form closes, the name field empties, both fields let go of the keyboard, the path opens with no step, and the map is marked dirty.

